Significance: minor
Type: update

Exclude checkout-draft orders from unfiltered order queries (status=any or unspecified). This affects the REST API (GET /wc/v3/orders with no status filter), direct HPOS queries via OrdersTableQuery, and WP_Query-based queries on post-table stores. Consumers relying on checkout-draft orders appearing in unfiltered results must explicitly request them via `status=checkout-draft`.